   "source": "edge",
   "name": "fractional_grace_crosses_midnight",
   "rationale": "A grace of 0.5 day adds 12h: 18:00 + 10.5d is 06:00 on May 12, so the deadline is May 12 and paying then gives 2.20. A port that ignores the fraction gives 0.00.",
